  "prefLabel": "Site 102.37 Proof by a preponderance of the evidence",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.37 “Proof by a preponderance of the evidence” means that what is sought to be proved is determined to be more probable than not.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15 (from Site 102.16)",
